    "detailed_description": "A story-driven open world, action-adventure RPG set on a mysterious island where the player takes on the role of Tim.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTim is living a normal life as a geeky, introverted boy. <br />\r\nHe is struggling with his identity and the loss of his best friends, and feels out of place.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe island has a hidden history, a civilization that existed there long ago.<br />\r\nThis civilization was able to harness the power of ether, a powerful source of magic or energy, and were able to create advanced technology and develop powerful abilities.",
